language design-core version 0.6.
message ModelChangeAccepted.
message ModelChangeRefused.
contract ModelOperationProtocol.
contract ModelOperationRequest.
field ModelOperationRequestAction.
field ModelOperationRequestExpectedHead.
field ModelOperationRequestInputDigest.
contract ModelOperationResult.
field ModelOperationResultDisposition.
field ModelOperationResultHead.
field ModelOperationResultSourceDigest.
channel ModelOperations.
scenario RejectStaleModelChange.
message RequestModelChange.
scenario SaveModelCheckpoint.
ModelChangeAccepted has message-kind = result.
ModelChangeAccepted replies-to RequestModelChange.
ModelChangeAccepted upholds ModelOperationResult.
ModelChangeRefused has message-kind = result.
ModelChangeRefused replies-to RequestModelChange.
ModelChangeRefused upholds ModelOperationResult.
ModelCommandAdapter uses ModelOperations as receiver of ModelChangeAccepted in mode ModelEditing.
ModelCommandAdapter uses ModelOperations as receiver of ModelChangeRefused in mode ModelEditing.
ModelCommandAdapter uses ModelOperations as sender of RequestModelChange in mode ModelEditing.
ModelCoordinator uses ModelOperations as receiver of RequestModelChange in mode ModelEditing.
ModelCoordinator uses ModelOperations as sender of ModelChangeAccepted in mode ModelEditing.
ModelCoordinator uses ModelOperations as sender of ModelChangeRefused in mode ModelEditing.
ModelOperationProtocol has completeness = closed.
ModelOperationProtocol permits ModelChangeAccepted.
ModelOperationProtocol permits ModelChangeRefused.
ModelOperationProtocol permits RequestModelChange.
ModelOperationRequest has completeness = closed.
ModelOperationRequest has-field ModelOperationRequestAction.
ModelOperationRequest has-field ModelOperationRequestExpectedHead.
ModelOperationRequest has-field ModelOperationRequestInputDigest.
ModelOperationRequestAction has presence = required.
ModelOperationRequestAction has value-type = text.
ModelOperationRequestExpectedHead has presence = required.
ModelOperationRequestExpectedHead has value-type = text.
ModelOperationRequestInputDigest has presence = required.
ModelOperationRequestInputDigest has value-type = text.
ModelOperationResult has completeness = closed.
ModelOperationResult has-field ModelOperationResultDisposition.
ModelOperationResult has-field ModelOperationResultHead.
ModelOperationResult has-field ModelOperationResultSourceDigest.
ModelOperationResultDisposition has presence = required.
ModelOperationResultDisposition has value-type = text.
ModelOperationResultHead has presence = required.
ModelOperationResultHead has value-type = text.
ModelOperationResultSourceDigest has presence = required.
ModelOperationResultSourceDigest has value-type = text.
ModelOperations upholds ModelOperationProtocol.
RejectStaleModelChange exercises RecoverWorkingModel.
RejectStaleModelChange has completeness = closed.
RejectStaleModelChange illustrates ModelGovernanceDelivery.
RejectStaleModelChange runs-in ModelEditing.
RejectStaleModelChange step 1 sends RequestModelChange from ModelCommandAdapter to ModelCoordinator via ModelOperations.
RejectStaleModelChange step 2 sends ModelChangeRefused from ModelCoordinator to ModelCommandAdapter via ModelOperations reply-to 1.
RequestModelChange has message-kind = request.
RequestModelChange upholds ModelOperationRequest.
SaveModelCheckpoint exercises RecoverWorkingModel.
SaveModelCheckpoint has completeness = closed.
SaveModelCheckpoint illustrates ModelGovernanceDelivery.
SaveModelCheckpoint runs-in ModelEditing.
SaveModelCheckpoint step 1 sends RequestModelChange from ModelCommandAdapter to ModelCoordinator via ModelOperations.
SaveModelCheckpoint step 2 sends ModelChangeAccepted from ModelCoordinator to ModelCommandAdapter via ModelOperations reply-to 1.
